date-released: "2026-09-17"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22818176"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "Standalone MATLAB implementation of a rat-parameterized QSP model of PEGylated liposomal doxorubicin and ellagic acid"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Samaroo"
    given-names: "Justin Mark"
repository-code: "https://github.com/justinsamaroo/pld-ea-qsp-model"
url: "https://github.com/justinsamaroo/pld-ea-qsp-model"
abstract: >-
  A standalone MATLAB ordinary differential equation implementation of a
  rat-parameterized quantitative systems pharmacology model integrating
  PEGylated liposomal doxorubicin pharmacokinetics, tumor response, cardiac
  biomarkers, reactive oxygen species, cardiac function, and ellagic acid
  pharmacokinetics.
keywords:
  - "quantitative systems pharmacology"
  - "PEGylated liposomal doxorubicin"
  - "ellagic acid"
  - "cardiotoxicity"
  - "pharmacometrics"
  - "sensitivity analysis"
